{"title": "Martial Bravery", "pageid": 28349, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Martial_Bravery", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Martial Bravery</b> is a passive feature that grants the wearer increased damage when surrounded by 2 or more enemies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your weapon and unarmed attacks deal an additional 2 damage while surrounded by 2 or more foes. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet\" title=\"Scabby Pugilist Circlet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Scabby_Pugilist_Circlet\" title=\"Scabby Pugilist Circlet\">Scabby Pugilist Circlet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Though not mentioned in the description, Martial Bravery also increases the damage of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attacks.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Due to faulty exclusionary check within the <code>HasEnemyWithinRange()</code> conditional script, Martial Bravery still functions with nearby unconscious and incapacitated enemies as long as <i>there is at least one conscious enemy nearby</i> (alive and not incapacitated).</li>\n<li>Despite the description, two or more enemies must be within 3 m (10 ft) <i>of the target</i>, not the wearer of the circlet. This means the wearer does not need to be \"surrounded\" at all; they need enemies near the target of their attack.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202244\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1111/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9796/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4048/4194304 bytes